{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03197","headline":"送李庶子致仕还洛 · 杨炯","name":"送李庶子致仕还洛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此地倾城日，由来供帐华。\n亭逢李广骑，门接邵平瓜。\n原野烟氛匝，关河游望赊。\n白云断岩岫，绿草覆江沙。\n诏赐扶阳宅，人荣御史车。\n灞池一相送，流涕向烟霞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨炯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03197.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03197","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}